omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UVm7McLXX1UQ7kNvwFv7dux&_nc_oc=AdqKzRJ5u05CbWxIjlH02gIhFjeieIwvjUJTVtTLQI9hUL3FyzUjVKucvM8ixPn-sFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af54w6nuQqc8CwaXUUM9CJyAWrx56BmTjHmWZ4J_Ur0UIw&oe=6A1C5234"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ut08Rx0nqD4Q7kNvwHVrX-T&_nc_oc=AdrDPzYg-AcNRC1EqCh2WRiSm_91H7LKgowZcWLbqbM3BG47G7ClR5AMb_tY2PeY1LE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7O4ldsX4VUo8bS2TCYpgwSXacyOPqvOaKZELCG-23VhA&oe=6A1C5396"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_YSt2KVpjbwQ7kNvwFxBUPq&_nc_oc=AdrA_rUBOGTTYHgq4oH4Cqvk-Ao-h_3ODb8kE_o7-meDG_6Tw4lsNzW_f47qu1lH280&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5zHhJVEHLK5OuL-HxoeoXxA-NRbsF9qm0S_xVcZJMkOw&oe=6A1C3077"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://